{{#if this.craGuidance}}
== EU Cyber Resilience Act

The manufacturer of a product with digital elements keeps the technical documentation and the EU declaration of conformity at the disposal of the market surveillance authorities for at least ten years after the product has been placed on the market, or for the support period, whichever is longer (Regulation (EU) 2024/2847, Article 13(13)). Add these records of each product to the plan. Also keep the records of the notifications under Article 14.
